OL,3,ANandy and Farage field questions from
OL,4,AKuenssberg on UK-EU ties
OL,5,
OL,6,FCulture Secretary Lisa Nandy tells the
OL,7,FBBC's Laura Kuenssberg a closer
OL,8,Frelationship with Europe is in the UK's
OL,9,Finterest
OL,11,FReform UK's Nigel Farage tells the
OL,12,Fprogramme the government's proposed
OL,13,Fyouth mobility scheme would "open the
OL,14,Fdoor to uncontrolled immigration"
OL,16,FAlso speaking to Kuenssberg, former EU
OL,17,Fchief negotiator Michel Barnier says
OL,18,Fthe UK cannot "cherry pick" a EU single
OL,19,Fmarket deal
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
