OL,3,ANandy and Farage field questions from
OL,4,AKuenssberg on UK-EU ties
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after PM Andy Burnham said he
OL,7,Fwanted to explore closer economic ties
OL,8,Fwith Europe ahead of the the UK-EU
OL,9,Fsummit later this month
OL,11,FAsked about Russell Brand's conviction
OL,12,Ffor rape and sexual assault, Nandy says
OL,13,Ftime is up for exploitation in the
OL,14,Fmedia industry - but adds: "I can't
OL,15,Fhand on heart say it isn't still
OL,16,Fhappening"
